e 1º/1/2025: como não dá para saber se não houve veto ou se ele não foi cadastrado, o perfil do prefeito não mostra o número de vetos."],"notas_en":["The City Council does not record in SAPL the progress of most bills (60 of 60 filed since January 1, 2025), so their status shows as not recorded.","Each councilor's office spending is not included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not have it.","This City Council's SAPL system does not list the city's laws for the current term, so the mayor's profile does not show how many laws were signed.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-26"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-29","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.cmbacabal.ma.gov.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.bacabal.ma.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.bacabal.ma.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.bacabal.ma.gov.br/","transparencia":"https://www.bacabal.ma.gov.br/transparencia","sic":"https://www.bacabal.ma.gov.br/esic","diarioOficial":{"nome":"Diário Oficial do Município de Bacabal","url":"https://www.bacabal.ma.gov.br/diario","plataforma":"Própria (site oficial)"},"conferido":"2026-10-23"}}}
